    "evidence": "the quality of results depends on how much information you provide it and how well-crafted the prompt is.",
    "origin": "authored"
   },
   {
    "q": "What is Top P?",
    "options": [
     "The most popular prompt template",
     "The maximum number of tokens in a reply",
     "A ranking of the best models",
     "A sampling technique (nucleus sampling) that controls how deterministic the model is"
    ],
    "answer": 3,
    "explain": "Lower Top P (or temperature) gives more deterministic, factual answers; higher gives more varied ones.",
